WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:09.710
How staff sign in to the staff app, clock in inside the mall's circle, take a break and clock out.

2
00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:18.400
Staff clock in with the staff app on their own phone. HR gives each person a code and a six-digit PIN.

3
00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:21.580
Type your employee code.

4
00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:24.530
And your PIN.

5
00:00:24.530 --> 00:00:30.530
Sign in. The first phone you sign in on becomes your phone.

6
00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:39.020
The first time, it explains what is recorded: your position only when you clock and while you are clocked in.

7
00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:42.230
Choose I understand and agree.

8
00:00:42.230 --> 00:00:50.720
The app finds you and shows how far you are from the mall. Inside the circle, the button wakes up.

9
00:00:50.720 --> 00:00:58.960
Clock in. The office checks the distance, the signal and that this is your phone.

10
00:00:58.980 --> 00:01:06.670
You are clocked in. Keep the app open while you work: it updates your position every few minutes.

11
00:01:06.670 --> 00:01:14.540
Going on a break? Start a break, and end it when you are back.

12
00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:18.740
End the break.

13
00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:24.150
At the end of the shift, Clock out, inside the circle again.

14
00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:31.830
Today lists every clocking. My month and Fix a time are at the bottom, if you forgot one.
